// 头部原本有一条给「头像悬浮换图角标」着色的规则；该角标只有旧组件库的 Upload 才渲染，
// 头像现在是纯 Semi Avatar、不再可换，节点不存在，规则一并删除。
// / The header used to colour an avatar hover "change photo" badge. That badge only existed
// because the old Upload rendered it; the avatar is now a plain Semi Avatar with no upload, so
// the node is gone and the rule went with it.
.header
  height 200px
  display flex
  justify-content center
  align-items center
  color var(--semi-color-text-0)
  border-radius 4px
  position relative

  .user-msg
    line-height 20px

    &-text
      display inline-block
      margin-left 6px
      vertical-align middle

.header::after
  background url('./assets/header-banner.png') no-repeat
  background-size 100%
  height 200px
  width 100%
  position absolute
  top 0
  left 0
  opacity 0.4
  content ' '

.header-content
  position relative
  z-index 2

.project-wrapper
  cursor pointer

  :global
    // Semi Typography.Title heading={5} 渲染为 h5.semi-typography
    // / Semi Typography.Title heading={5} renders as h5.semi-typography
    h5.semi-typography
      margin-top 0
      margin-bottom 6px
      font-size 14px

    // Semi Typography.Text type="secondary" → .semi-typography-secondary
    // / Semi Typography.Text type="secondary" → .semi-typography-secondary
    .semi-typography-secondary
      font-size 12px
      margin-left 12px

// 列表项由 Semi List 渲染，类名 .semi-list-item；Semi 默认不给列表项加 hover 底色与
// 末项分隔线（分隔线只在 split 模式下出现），因此这里只需改写内边距。
// / List items come from Semi List as .semi-list-item. Semi adds neither a hover background
// nor a trailing divider by default (dividers only appear with `split`), so only padding
// needs overriding here.
.team-list
  :global(.semi-list-item)
    padding 8px 0

    &:last-child
      padding-bottom 0

.news-list
  :global(.semi-list-item)
    padding 24px 4px

    &:last-child
      padding-bottom 4px

// 取代原 List.Item.Meta 的外层：头像 + 内容两栏，间距与 Meta 头像列一致
// / Replaces the outer part of List.Item.Meta: avatar + content columns, spaced like Meta's
// avatar column
.list-item
  display flex
  align-items flex-start
  gap 16px

// 取代原 List.Item.Meta 的内容列：撑满剩余宽度并允许子元素收缩，标题/描述才能正常换行省略
// / Replaces List.Item.Meta's content column: fills the remaining width and lets children
// shrink, so the title/description can wrap or ellipsize correctly
.list-item-content
  flex 1
  min-width 0

// 标题行；旧实现用 h4 自带 4px 下外边距，这里显式归零
// / Replaces the old List.Item.Meta title row (h4, which carried a 4px bottom margin)
.list-item-title
  margin 0 0 4px
